.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH SPT-DIAGNOSE 1  "diagnose " 
.SH NAME
diagnose \- Targeted diagnostics and support bundles
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdiagnose\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Targeted diagnostics and support bundles
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
diagnose\-run(1)
Run a battery of diagnostic checks
.TP
diagnose\-network(1)
Network checks
.TP
diagnose\-auth(1)
Authentication checks for a profile
.TP
diagnose\-trust(1)
Trust checks for a profile
.TP
diagnose\-dns(1)
DNS checks
.TP
diagnose\-bind(1)
Bind checks
.TP
diagnose\-port(1)
Probe a host:port
.TP
diagnose\-service(1)
Service\-manager checks
.TP
diagnose\-secrets(1)
Secret\-backend checks
.TP
diagnose\-observability(1)
Observability sink checks
.TP
diagnose\-mcp(1)
MCP server checks
.TP
diagnose\-bundle(1)
Build a redacted support bundle
.TP
diagnose\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  spt diagnose run \-\-all \-\-report report.json
  spt diagnose port \-\-host db \-\-port 5432 \-\-tcp \-\-autodetect\-service
  spt diagnose bundle \-\-out support.tgz \-\-redacted \-\-since 24h
  spt diagnose service \-\-config /etc/ssh\-perma\-tunnel/config.toml \-\-system
  spt diagnose dns \-\-name db.local
